    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4a8.svg"> Ger&#231;ek Coşku &#214;zg&#252;rl&#252;kt&#252;r <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127807;"
    title="herb"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f33f.svg"><img
